%% UI owners: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/rust/helix/crates/helix-im/src/module/trait_impl.rs::启动扫描 channel_event_cursor 后恢复；/System/Volumes/Data/workspace/rust/helix/crates/helix-im/src/ws/handlers/increment_channel_end.rs::hello 全局 increment-end 主动补偿；/System/Volumes/Data/workspace/rust/helix/crates/helix-im/src/ws/handlers/pong.rs::heartbeat gaps / hashMismatch 补偿
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员合盖 / 断网一段时间后回来，期间的新消息、编辑、撤回、已读全部补齐，且不重复也不遗漏
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=missing；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  UI->>Gate: 订阅 同步 / gap 补偿（当前 Gate 由 inbound event 驱动）
  Go-->>WS: authority event / channel update
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(bytes)
  E->>IM: dispatch inbound event
  IM->>IM: 校验 event_seq、generation、viewer scope 与幂等键
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /api/cses/channel/sync/notify + append-only channel_event / per-channel event_seq
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction channel/event_seq + sync cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（postReceived，POST，postUpdated，POST_UPDATE，postDeleted，postsBatchUpdated，POSTS_UPDATE，channelUpdate）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：本端 per-channel cursor 只从账号库读取，并与消息、频道绝对投影在同一持久化事务成功后单调推进至已覆盖的 event_seq；事务失败不得推进，补齐区间为 (本端 eventSeq, 服务端最新] 左开右闭；对端独立维护自己的 cursor：禁止把本端 cursor 值复制给对端（每个 viewer 的 cursor 各自推进）；channel_event 类型映射：New=1 → postReceived / Edit=2 → postUpdated / Delete=3 → postDeleted（含离线撤回重放）/ Read=6 → snapshotId 对齐的有序 ID/绝对 receipt 投影 / Close=7 → 频道关闭态；Angular 不见 readBits；gap 大于 5000 只表示超过单次恢复的回放预算，不表示 channel_event 已过 retention；TooLong 只重建命中的单频道，保留旧历史可读，权威窗口拉取成功后把窗口与 cursor 原子覆盖，失败则旧窗口与 cursor 均保持不变
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：Angular 不得拥有 syncChannels 业务 Port、cursor map、gap/TooLong 判断、重连补偿队列或 visibility 触发状态机；现存 Pending 空实现不得被扩成第二套同步内核；eventSeq 不得与业务行序号（消息 ordering / 消息 id）同源：Mock 已用 localIdSeq 与 channelEventSeq 解耦，禁止回退到 mock-msg-$seq 与 eventSeq 同源的形态（违反 Go「事件序号与业务行序号解耦」）；不得把 5000 描述为 channel_event retention 边界；当前 Go 没有物理保留窗口或 minAvailableSeq 合同，5000 仅是回放预算
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：postReceived，POST，postUpdated，POST_UPDATE，postDeleted，postsBatchUpdated，POSTS_UPDATE，channelUpdate；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
